  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 1302.41 Resident project representative",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 1302.41 “Resident project representative” means an individual who:\n\n(a) Is qualified by reason of education and experience to inspect infrastructure projects; and\n\n(b) Reports to a licensed professional engineer if necessary based on the project and type of work to be done.\n\nSource. #12903, eff 10-23-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-dw1300.html"
